      "control_name": "SageMaker Pipeline Must Use Customer-Managed KMS Key",
      "control_description": "SageMaker pipeline must encrypt artifacts and intermediate data with a customer-managed KMS key. Without CMK encryption, pipeline outputs — trained models, processed datasets, evaluation results — are encrypted only with the default AWS-managed key, which the organization cannot rotate, audit, or revoke independently.\n",
